{
  "suite": "deduplicate-suggestions",
  "description": "Turns a raw search response into the list a client renders. Four rules and the order between them is the contract: (1) recipes are lifted out first, always lead, and are never deduplicated away; (2) results in the requested language come first ONLY when there are at least 3 of them — below that the server order is kept whole, NOT same-language-first, so a port that always sorts by language is wrong; (3) the remainder is deduplicated by lowercased+trimmed label, first occurrence winning, AND by brand alongside the label — two products of the same name from different brands are separate rows, the same name and brand is noise, and a brandless product keys on the label alone so it collapses into the curated ingredient of that name; (4) the result is capped, and recipes count toward the cap but are never dropped by it, so an all-recipe response may exceed it. Recipe labels are NOT added to the seen set, so a recipe and an ingredient with the same label both survive. Deduplication is never by ingredientId, which is unique per row and would dedupe nothing.",
  "generatedBy": "pocket-nutrition-sandbox — npm run vectors:build",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "collapses-the-real-poulet-response",
      "why": "The exact shape that motivated the suite, copied from the live API: one curated ingredient labelled \"poulet\" and three OFF products labelled \"Poulet\". Because the key is lowercased, all four share it and the whole response collapses to the ONE row a user can act on — the curated ingredient, which leads because the server ranked it first. Four indistinguishable rows became one; that is the entire point.",
      "input": {
        "items": [
          {
            "ingredientId": "chicken",
            "label": "poulet",
            "lang": "fr",
            "productType": "ingredient",
            "brand": null
          },
          {
            "ingredientId": "off:0000300000685",
            "label": "Poulet",
            "lang": "en",
            "productType": "off_product",
            "brand": null
          },
          {
            "ingredientId": "off:0706799200064",
            "label": "Poulet",
            "lang": "en",
            "productType": "off_product",
            "brand": null
          },
          {
            "ingredientId": "off:0266405058644",
            "label": "Poulet",
            "lang": "en",
            "productType": "off_product",
            "brand": null
          }
        ],
        "preferLang": "fr"
      },
      "expected": [
        {
          "ingredientId": "chicken",
          "label": "poulet",
          "lang": "fr",
          "productType": "ingredient",
          "brand": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
